lg:DK-227-2002-s7-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "c49b6e1ab89d7f2b5da17d4154b8968c7e4dcb7f6a9f9e17b187c52748980527" ;
    lgo:text """§ 7. A service provider shall provide information on
1) the service provider's name,
2) the physical address where the service provider is established,
3) an e-mail address and, where applicable, a postal address and other information about the service provider that makes it possible to contact and communicate with the service provider,
4) the CVR number, if the service provider is registered in the Central Business Register,
5) membership of any approval schemes, including the relevant supervisory authority."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002-s7-1-q1 .

lg:DK-227-2002-s7-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a976e4a4b9177ed8cfcac3b35e20e0ed38fc3fdb56288114d8af9163c09aa1e6" ;
    lgo:text """Stk. 2. A service provider practising a regulated profession shall additionally provide
1) information on any trade organisation or similar body in which the service provider is registered,
2) information on the professional title and the Member State in which it was awarded, and
3) a reference to the professional rules applicable to the regulated profession and how access to them can be obtained."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002-s7-2-q1 .

lg:DK-227-2002-s7-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a5d730c77edc25f8600ee93d4d8121bad8ba48db2f262d49212c3522c5746f1e" ;
    lgo:text "Stk. 3. Recipients of the service and the authorities shall have easy and permanent access to the information referred to in subsections 1 and 2."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002-s7-3-q1 .

lg:DK-227-2002-s8-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a33038cbbb7335bdae533c477d2c301ebce6ebc09d45dce41117654aa6c950c6" ;
    lgo:text "§ 8. Where information on the price of an information-society service is given, the price shall be indicated clearly and unambiguously. It shall be apparent whether the price includes taxes and delivery costs."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin-swe2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DK-227-2002-s8-1-q1 .

